{"translation-revision-date":"2025-09-20 12:04+0100","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"assets\/js\/driverjs-strings.js","domain":"form-quizz-fqi3","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"form-quizz-fqi3","lang":"es","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Configure your GitHub personal token here to enable access to add-ons and receive updates for the core plugin and installed add-ons.":[""],"License":[""],"General Settings":["Configuraci\u00f3n general"],"Levels Settings":["Configuraci\u00f3n de niveles"],"Access Control":["Control de acceso"],"Content Options":["Opciones de contenido"],"API Options":["Opciones de API"],"Tools":["Herramientas"],"Configure the plugin's core options, such as sales page link, daily\/free trial limits and question limits. Data deletion, social sharing, statistics and purge tools are available in the Tools tab.":[""],"Set the quiz levels: id, name and free or not":[""],"This access control system allows you to define granular roles and permissions for different features and grant Premium features to administrators.":["Este sistema de control de acceso permite definir funciones y permisos granulares para las distintas funcionalidades de la plataforma"],"Email Options":["Opciones de correos"],"Configure email notifications, disable them if necessary, upload an image for emails, set the time to send reminders, and test sending emails to the administrator.":[""],"Enable RTL mode for right-to-left languages, customize the title\/description before the quiz form, and set text, background, and button colors for an interface that suits your needs.":[""],"Badge Management":["Nombre de la insignia:"],"Disable badges or their legends, and manage badges related to quiz completion level and success rate, provided that statistics are enabled.":[""],"Enable access to plugin data via REST API and generate an API token to secure requests.":[""],"Maintenance and utilities: enable automatic purge of attempts via daily cron, set the retention period (days), run a manual purge from the Attempts page, and manage data-related options (delete data on uninstall, disable social sharing and statistics).":[""],"Questions Bank":["Preguntas"],"Create, manage, and reuse shared questions across quizzes. This tab is provided by the Questions Bank add-on.":[""]}}}